OL,3,GYorkshire & Humber
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy and
OL,6,Fdamp start to the night with some
OL,7,Frain, with little change likely
OL,8,Fthrough the night. Some mist and fog
OL,9,Freturning, mostly across hills. Light
OL,10,Fwinds but breezy along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FOutbreaks of light rain
OL,13,Faffecting most areas will move
OL,14,Fsouthwards to leave a drier and
OL,15,Fpossibly brighter end to Thursday
OL,16,Facross northern areas. Drier overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
